feature a user can start a session
  Sessions are opaque tokens stored server-side. Creating one hands back a
  token; validating one answers who it belongs to.

  contains
    lua/auth.lua:create_session
    lua/auth.lua:validate_token
    lua/store.lua:put

feature a session can be refreshed
  An unexpired token can be traded for a fresh one without re-authenticating.

  contains
    lua/auth.lua:refresh_token
